  "description": "Dapper metadata store for DotNetBoost.Media, for applications that do not use EF Core. One\n      table records every upload, in the same shape the EF Core store maps — so a database serves\n      either — with optional startup DDL, transaction enlistment so a file and its entity commit\n      together, and SQL written for SQL Server, PostgreSQL and SQLite.",
